    "body": "Worked in bash with two warnings:\r\n\r\n```\r\nrenato@renato-laptop:~/projectspace/personal_vim$ eval \"$(starship init bash)\"\r\n[WARN] - (starship::configs::battery): Unknown config key 'threshold'\r\n[WARN] - (starship::configs::battery): Unknown config key 'style'\r\n```\r\n\r\nIn zsh it still looks like normal zsh without showing git infos in repo directories.\r\neval $(starship init zsh) returning exit code 0 with no messages or warnings or logs.\r\n\r\n",
