    "body": "To get rid of those warnings alter your config so that the following section:\n```toml\n[​battery​]\n​threshold​ = ​10​\n​style​ = ​'​red bold​'​\n```\n\nbecomes:\n```toml\n[​[battery.display​]]\n​threshold​ = ​10​\n​style​ = ​'​red bold​'​\n```",
